如图所示所求质心为

图示：坐标轴原点标为 $O$，横轴标为 $x$，纵轴标为 $y$；曲线标为 $y=\sqrt{2px}$，右侧竖线位于 $x_0$，曲线、横轴与竖线围成区域 $D$ 并画有阴影。

$$
M=\iint_D \mu\,dxdy
=\mu\int_0^{x_0}dx\int_0^{\sqrt{2px}}dy
=\frac{2}{3}\mu\sqrt{2p x_0^3}
$$

$$
\bar{x}
=\frac{\iint_D x\mu\,dxdy}{M}
=\frac{\int_0^{x_0}x\mu\,dx\int_0^{\sqrt{2px}}dy}{\frac{2}{3}\mu\sqrt{2p x_0^3}}
=\frac{3x_0}{5}
$$

$$
\bar{y}
=\frac{\iint_D y\mu\,dxdy}{M}
=\frac{\int_0^{x_0}\mu\,dx\int_0^{\sqrt{2px}}y\,dy}{\frac{2}{3}\mu\sqrt{2p x_0^3}}
=\frac{3y_0}{8}
$$

